---
const groups = [
  {
    heading: "Agents & inference",
    note: "Where the thinking happens",
    items: ["Workers AI", "Agents SDK", "AI Gateway", "Durable Objects", "Model routing", "MCP tooling"],
  },
  {
    heading: "Data & memory",
    note: "Where the context lives",
    items: ["Vectorize", "D1", "R2", "KV", "Hyperdrive", "Analytics Engine"],
  },
  {
    heading: "Orchestration",
    note: "Where the work gets done",
    items: ["Workflows", "Queues", "Cron Triggers", "Containers", "Browser Rendering", "Service bindings"],
  },
  {
    heading: "Delivery & protection",
    note: "What ships and guards it",
    items: ["Pages", "Zero Trust", "Access", "WAF & bot defence", "Turnstile", "Logpush"],
  },
];
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">The platform</span>
        <h2 class="text-title mt-5 font-display font-semibold text-ink text-balance">
          Cloudflare stopped being a CDN. We build on the whole thing.
        </h2>
        <p class="measure mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft text-pretty">
          Cloudflare now runs the full path of an AI product: model inference, agent orchestration, vector search,
          durable state, storage, and the security in front of it. That means one platform instead of six, and one
          bill instead of a spreadsheet. We know it from the primitives up.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">One vendor</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">One deploy</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">No glue infrastructure</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {
          groups.map((group) => (
            <div class="hairline pt-6">
              <h3 class="font-display text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink">{group.heading}</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-[13px] text-ink-mute">{group.note}</p>
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
                {group.items.map((item) => (
                  <li class="text-[15px] text-ink-soft">{item}</li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
